<title>INDIA: Delhi Stock Exchange sets session for Saturday.</title>
<headline>Delhi Stock Exchange sets session for Saturday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Delhi Stock Exchange (DSE) will hold a special trading session on Saturday, in line with the Bombay and National Stock Exchanges, bourse officials said.</p>
<p>Exchange officials told Reuters on Friday the DSE would be open for trade from 9:45 a.m. (0415 GMT) to 2:15 P.M. (0845 GMT).</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
